817772 -rw-r--r-- 2 root root 20 Oct 14 21:32 hard_link
817774 lrwxrwxrwx 1 root root 11 Oct 14 21:32 symbolic_link -> ../file.txt

$: cd ~

$: mv D1/D2/file.txt D1/

$: cat D1/D2/D3/hard_link
Hello from file.txt

$: cat D1/D2/D3/symbolic_link
